  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nI would like to run a server, and be able to advertise our matrix using join links.\r\nHowever, one concern I have with this is that these links might leak, and trolls might use them to join as well.\r\nTherefore, as an admin I would like to be able to screen users joining using a link, such that we could either approve or deny such join requests.\r\n",
